WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:09.395
The other day, I met a bear.

2
00:00:09.396 --> 00:00:14.334
A way up there, a great big bear.

3
00:00:14.335 --> 00:00:17.888
He looked at me, I looked at him.

4
00:00:17.889 --> 00:00:22.841
He sized up me, I sized up him.

5
00:00:22.842 --> 00:00:26.320
He said to me, "Why don't you run?

6
00:00:26.321 --> 00:00:29.244
I see you don't have any gun."

7
00:00:29.245 --> 00:00:32.105
And so I ran away from there.

8
00:00:32.106 --> 00:00:36.495
And right behind me was that bear.

9
00:00:36.496 --> 00:00:39.274
Ahead of me I saw a tree.

10
00:00:39.275 --> 00:00:43.430
A great big tree, oh golly gee!

11
00:00:43.431 --> 00:00:46.629
The lowest branch was ten feet up.

12
00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:50.241
I had to jump and trust my luck.

13
00:00:50.242 --> 00:00:53.176
And so I jumped into the air.

14
00:00:53.177 --> 00:00:56.961
And missed that branch a way up there.

15
00:00:56.962 --> 00:01:00.228
Now don't you fret and don't you frown.

16
00:01:00.229 --> 00:01:04.174
I caught that branch on the way back down.

17
00:01:04.175 --> 00:01:07.425
That's all there is, there is no more.

18
00:01:07.426 --> 00:01:11.784
Until I meet that bear once more.

19
00:01:11.785 --> 00:01:15.065
The end, the end, the end, the end.

20
00:01:15.066 --> 00:01:18.794
This time it really is the end!
